"
|     <p {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|       class="notes"
|       id="fontChange"
|       style="display: none;"
|       "If you are unable to see font glyphs for certain characters using the browsers default font you can apply a specific font by typing its name in the following box: "
|       <input {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|         class="css"
|         id="fontName"
|         name="fontName"
|         type="text"
|         value=""
|       " "
|       <button {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
|         class="notes"
|         onclick="setFontFamily()"
|         type="button"
|         "Apply"
|     <script {http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml}>
